  "bodyHash": "40016cb2b0cddd36",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎來到由 Soar49 發起、採用平滑風格的 64x 材質包「Soartex」之粉絲延續計畫！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這裡提供 Soartex Fanver Universal（通用版）材質包的下載。通用版同時包含原版與模組用的材質。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:70886\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.16</span></a> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:68722\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.15</span></a> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:628\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.12</span></a> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:599\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.11</span></a> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:572\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.10</span></a> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.8</span></a> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:5\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.7</span></a> - </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.6</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:11\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.5</span></a> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:12\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.4</span></a> - </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:13\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.3</span></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我們歡迎大家為模組相容性貢獻力量！目前對 1.15/1.16 的支援剛推出，功能尚不完整。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若想參與開發，請加入我們的 Discord，並在相關模組倉庫中開啟 Issue 或提交 Pull Request <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/Soartex-Modded/\" rel=\"nofollow\">於對應的倉庫頁面</a>。<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若下載過程遇到問題，或發現材質存在錯誤，請使用上方的問題回報系統。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您可以在此找到原版材質包的下載連結：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-vanilla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此處</a>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">關於二次分發與一般問題的更多資訊，請瀏覽我們的網站：</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fsoartex.net%252flicense%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://soartex.net/license/<br></a><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">官方 </span><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">Minecraft 論壇 </span><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">原貼如下：</span><a style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\" href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/resource-packs/1237576-1-7-x-x64-soartex-fanver-smooth-and-clean\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/resource-packs/1237576-1-7-x-x64-soartex-fanver-smooth-and-clean<br></a><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">官方 Planet Minecraft 原貼如下：</span><a style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture_pack%252fsoartex-fanver%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.planetminecraft.com/texture_pack/soartex-fanver/<br></a><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">官方 Feed the Beast 論壇原貼如下：</span><a style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fforum.feed-the-beast.com%252fthreads%252f39834%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://forum.feed-the-beast.com/threads/39834/</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
